# The build context is what the image installs, and nothing else. Most of this
# repository is either a reader's own data or the apparatus of working on the
# engine, and every file of it in the context is another way to invalidate a
# layer cache on a commit that changed nothing the image contains.
#
# An allowlist rather than a list of exclusions, so that a new directory is out
# until somebody says otherwise.
*
!LICENSE
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.txt
!src

# Re-excluded after the fact, because these appear inside src/ once the package
# has been installed in editable mode and are not part of it.
src/**/__pycache__
src/**/*.egg-info
